# Personal terms the pre-push PHI gate blocks. Copy to
# .githooks/pii-denylist.local.txt (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# One term per line, case-insensitive substring match. Matches are reported
# MASKED, so the failure message never reproduces the term it caught.
#
# What belongs here — anything that identifies a real person, place, device or
# account, and that this repo has no reason to contain:
#   real legal names (yours, family, clinicians)
#   street address, city if small, postcode
#   provider and practice names, MRN or patient identifiers
#   insurance member or group numbers
#   real phone numbers not in 555-0100..555-0199
#   personalised device names ("a user's iPhone")
#   account emails and usernames
#
# What does NOT belong here:
#   medication names (public drug names, not personal information)
#   device model numbers (UA-651BLE, Polar H10)
#   vendor OUIs (00:09:1F) — the full-address check already covers the rest
